# ============================================================================
# Development-only files. These are NOT deployed, and for two of them that is
# not just tidiness:
#
#   _original/  holds material that must never be published — the unedited
#               owner portrait, the original logo, the cover banner and the
#               raw brand-logo files.
#   node_modules/  there are no dependencies, so it should never appear at all;
#               listed so a stray `npm install` cannot land it in the repo.
#
# The remaining dev scripts (_final.js, _contrast.js, _shot.js, _csp.js,
# _genbg.js, _getcats.js, _mkcats.ps1, _getfonts.js) are deliberately NOT
# ignored: they are the only record of how the assets were produced. They stay
# out of the published site for a different reason — GitHub Pages runs Jekyll,
# which excludes every path starting with an underscore. See `_config.yml`.
# ============================================================================
_original/
node_modules/

# OS junk
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.log
